\end{align}
Since $\nabla^2 f$ is Lipschitz continuous and compactly supported, $\nabla^2 f$ is also ${\varepsilon}$-H\"older
continuous for any ${\varepsilon} \in (0,1]$.
It follows that
\begin{align}
